+ * not acknowledged in the ServerHello. If the return value is
+ * |SSL_TLSEXT_ERR_ALERT_FATAL| or |SSL_TLSEXT_ERR_ALERT_WARNING| then
+ * |*out_alert| must be set to the alert value to send. */
