+ * STACK_OF:X509_POLICY_DATA
+ * STACK_OF:X509_POLICY_NODE
+ * STACK_OF:X509_PURPOSE
+ * STACK_OF:X509_REVOKED
+ * STACK_OF:X509_TRUST
+ * STACK_OF:X509_VERIFY_PARAM
